  "notes": [
    "Base assembly populates only R409/R410 from this block; no IC501 modification. Optional hardware remains explicit on native schematic.",
    "All optional NOR/control devices use CONSOLE_3V3, never the held-up +3V3_LOGIC rail. Ioff control inputs prevent logic-domain backpowering.",
    "All four custom NOR banks are writable when physically armed and explicitly authorized. No stock image occupies this NOR; whole-chip erase may destroy all custom banks but cannot erase original mask ROM.",
    "Physical selector is only changed with power disconnected. Stock recovery CE path is passive and remains operative without MCU or FPGA configuration.",
    "FPGA bank latch remains stable across MCU reset and ATA SRST/G1 reset; write authorization resets blocked. Reconfiguration requires a cold console restart or physical stock recovery.",
    "Counterfeit/substitute NOR, actual FPC contact orientation, full SI/timing/power ramp and optional populated PCB height require qualification."
  ]
